<Project>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <MongoGenericRepositoryVersion>12.3.0</MongoGenericRepositoryVersion>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
    A predicate passed to GetAll filters instead of becoming a sort key.

    Fixed:
    - GetAll(x => x.IsActive) bound to the sorting overload with TProperty = bool, because the type parameter of the filter overload cannot be inferred. It returned every document, sorted by the predicate, without a warning. A new non-generic GetAll(filter, page, pageSize, session) takes the predicate, so the same call now filters.
    - GetAllDescending(x => x.IsActive) had the same trap. A descending order needs a sorting expression, so the call is now a compile error (CS0619) pointing to GetAllDescending(filter, sorting).

    Added:
    - GetAll(filter, page, pageSize, session, cancellationToken): LINQ predicate with optional paging, no sort, session-aware.

    Behaviour change:
    - Code that used a bool lambda to sort now gets only the matching documents. To keep the sort, name the argument: GetAll(sorting: x => x.IsActive) and GetAllDescending(sorting: x => x.IsActive). An explicit type argument alone is ambiguous with the obsolete generic filter overloads until v13.
    - The binding is decided at compile time: code compiled against 12.2.0 or earlier, including libraries built on this package, keeps the old behaviour until it is recompiled.
    - A derived repository that overrides the generic GetAll(sorting) to add its own logic should override the new GetAll(filter) as well.
    - IReadOnlyDataRepository has two new members with default implementations; classes implementing the interface directly compile and load unchanged.

    See CHANGELOG.md for the full notes.
    </PackageReleaseNotes>
    
    <!-- Gemeinsame Metadaten für alle Pakete -->
    <Authors>Timm Bremekamp</Authors>
    <Company>FM-Gruppe</Company>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/emuuu/MongoRepository</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PackageLicenseFile>LICENSE</PackageLicenseFile>
    <PackageIcon>mongorepository_logo.png</PackageIcon>
    <Copyright>Copyright © $(Authors) $([System.DateTime]::Now.Year)</Copyright>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <NoWarn>$(NoWarn);1591</NoWarn>
  </PropertyGroup>
</Project>